# Optional: enable LIVE Google data.
# Create a Web-application OAuth Client ID in Google Cloud Console and add this
# site's origin to "Authorized JavaScript origins". Scopes:
#   gmail.readonly     - the inbox widgets and the briefing's live inbox
#   calendar.readonly  - the Weekly Briefing's live calendar
#   gmail.send         - optional, only for one-click Evernote filing
# One consent covers them all. Leave unset to run with sample data.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
